  - `position` must error for unknown ID or if called before the first successful load
  - crossings.sim lines must follow `[ID]:[Dauer]t` where Dauer==0 indicates roundabout and Dauer>0
  indicates crossing
  - The program must be able to simulate several hundred cars
  - Street nodes may have up to four incoming and four outgoing streets and must have at least one
  incoming and one outgoing street
